<title>UK: Ford Brazil sets $300 mln 8-year bond, call,puts.</title>
<headline>Ford Brazil sets $300 mln 8-year bond, call,puts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY	 NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE     ***</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +280-290 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED. PUT AND CALL AFTER FIVE-YEARS.</p>
<p>	   ***PAY DATE TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/IK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A SUPPORT AGREEMENT FROM FORD MOTOR CO.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE ISSUER'S $500 MLN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
